    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Go Slimey Go!</i> is an easy-to-pick-up game for all players! Easy to learn and hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by family-friendly platformers like Yoshi's Island and Kirby, it combines charm with challenge, with intuitive controls and progressively tougher levels that surprise players and test their skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/7ee22f81cbfce7c8579d4fb9137898fe.poster.avif?t=1755014478\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/7ee22f81cbfce7c8579d4fb9137898fe.gif?t=1755014478\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce your way through many meticulously hand crafted levels across five different worlds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't fight, avoid all conflict to reach your goal! Enemies are (mostly!) harmless, but little slippery you are harmless as well!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squishiness is your strongest weapon! Bounce onto, into and across enemies to reach new heights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive  boss battles where you are not the target! Try not to get caught in the ultimate showdown between good and evil!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/bed33cbc9d71950b264908dc06e4d993.poster.avif?t=1755014478\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/bed33cbc9d71950b264908dc06e4d993.webm?t=1755014478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/bed33cbc9d71950b264908dc06e4d993.mp4?t=1755014478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just go, Slimey, go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/484ff24ee28b91324d92cdb2d664a050.poster.avif?t=1755014478\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/484ff24ee28b91324d92cdb2d664a050.webm?t=1755014478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/484ff24ee28b91324d92cdb2d664a050.mp4?t=1755014478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Go Slimey Go!</i> is an easy-to-pick-up game for all players! Easy to learn and hard to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by family-friendly platformers like Yoshi's Island and Kirby, it combines charm with challenge, with intuitive controls and progressively tougher levels that surprise players and test their skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/7ee22f81cbfce7c8579d4fb9137898fe.poster.avif?t=1755014478\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/7ee22f81cbfce7c8579d4fb9137898fe.gif?t=1755014478\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce your way through many meticulously hand crafted levels across five different worlds!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't fight, avoid all conflict to reach your goal! Enemies are (mostly!) harmless, but little slippery you are harmless as well!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your squishiness is your strongest weapon! Bounce onto, into and across enemies to reach new heights!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive  boss battles where you are not the target! Try not to get caught in the ultimate showdown between good and evil!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/bed33cbc9d71950b264908dc06e4d993.poster.avif?t=1755014478\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/bed33cbc9d71950b264908dc06e4d993.webm?t=1755014478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/bed33cbc9d71950b264908dc06e4d993.mp4?t=1755014478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just go, Slimey, go!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/484ff24ee28b91324d92cdb2d664a050.poster.avif?t=1755014478\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/484ff24ee28b91324d92cdb2d664a050.webm?t=1755014478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3215230/extras/484ff24ee28b91324d92cdb2d664a050.mp4?t=1755014478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Go Slimey Go! is an easy-to-pick-up game for all players! Help Slimey, our tiny slippery protagonist, visit his friends for some well deserved teatime after some thrilling platforming challenges! Just make sure not to get caught in the middle of the ultimate showdown between good and evil!",
